<!--
    French. Everyday words, as banking and budgeting apps use them, rather than literal ones.
    The reader is addressed as "vous". A non-breaking space (\u00A0) goes before ? ! and :

    Glossary (keep these the same everywhere):
        transaction        transaction          expense    dépense        income    revenu
        savings / saved    épargne / épargné    balance    solde          amount    montant
        category           catégorie            settings   Paramètres     note      note
        backup / restore   sauvegarde / restaurer                         export    export, exporter
        delete             supprimer            save       enregistrer    cancel    annuler
        undo               annuler              search     rechercher     title     titre
        bill (scanned)     ticket               app lock   verrouillage de l’appli
        screen lock        verrouillage de l’écran   built-in / custom  par défaut / personnalisée

    Kept as they are: CSV, Excel, Google Sheets, cashback, freelance and the app's name.

    Numbers use Western digits. Not here on purpose: strings marked translatable="false"
    in values/strings.xml, which read the same in every language.
-->
